Date: Fri, 06 Mar 2026 09:14:22 +0100
Subject: DLP alert – m.dubois – CRM export to personal Google Drive
Message-ID: <q01-01@tectonic-solutions.be>

Hi Laurent, Catherine,

Three high-severity DLP alerts yesterday evening for Marc Dubois:
- 18:12 export of 4,312 CRM contacts to drive.google.com (personal account)
- 18:14 upload of Pricing_2026_confidential.xlsx to the same Drive
- 18:19 forward of the pricing file to marc.dubois84@gmail.com

Evidence (DLP-88490/91/92) attached. This is unambiguous – it's the full client base plus our 2026 price grid. Per the DLP Standard I am escalating to you; I have not contacted Marc.

Kristof

